}, {"text": "Boise", "type": "Loc", "start": 19, "end": 20}], "orig_id": 2547}}, {"id": "conll04:train:19", "source": "conll04", "text": "The strong Santa Ana winds that earlier produced wind gusts as high as 100 mph in Southern California , destroying a blimp , shutting down an airport , and cutting power to thousands of utility customers were subsiding , officials said .", "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start": 0, "end": 237, "parent": null, "level": 0}], "uri": null, "observed_at": 0, "grants": ["public"], "metadata": {"split": "train", "entities": [{"text": "Santa Ana", "type": "Loc", "start": 2, "end": 4}, {"text": "100 mph", "type": "Other", "start": 13, "end": 15}, {"text": "Southern California", "type": "Loc", "start": 16, "end": 18}], "orig_id": 1030}}, {"id": "conll04:train:20", "source": "conll04", "text": "But Sen. Strom Thurmond , R-S.C. , sponsor of a proposed constitutional amendment , said , ` ` An overwhelming majority of Americans are looking to the Congress to ... restore the proper civil respect for our American flag. ' '", "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start": 0, "end": 227, "parent": null, "level": 0}], "uri": null, "observed_at": 0, "grants": ["public"], "metadata": {"split": "train", "entities": [{"text": "Strom Thurmond", "type": "Peop", "start": 2, "end": 4}, {"text": "Americans", "type": "Other", "start": 22, "end": 23}, {"text": "Congress", "type": "Org", "start": 27, "end": 28}], "orig_id": 2274}}, {"id": "conll04:train:21", "source": "conll04", "text": "With considerable rough sailing and difficulty anticipated in the process of ratification by the U.S. Congress , the Congress is hardly expected to complete the ratification process within the time limit set by the UR agreement .", "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start": 0, "end": 229, "parent": null, "level": 0}], "uri": null, "observed_at": 0, "grants": ["public"], "metadata": {"split": "train", "entities": [{"text": "U.S.", "type": "Loc", "start": 14, "end": 15}, {"text": "Congress", "type": "Org", "start": 15, "end": 16}, {"text": "Congress", "type": "Org", "start": 18, "end": 19}], "orig_id": 4051}}, {"id": "conll04:train:22", "source": "conll04", "text": "In another scene , President James Garfield 's assassin Charles Guiteau ( Jonathan Hadary ) prances up and down the stairs of the gallows where he will be hanged , all the while singing a spirited Gospel tune about \" going to the Lordy . \"", "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start": 0, "end": 239, "parent": null, "level": 0}], "uri": null, "observed_at": 0, "grants": ["public"], "metadata": {"split": "train", "entities": [{"text": "President James Garfield", "type": "Peop", "start": 4, "end": 7}, {"text": "Charles Guiteau", "type": "Peop", "start": 9, "end": 11}, {"text": "Jonathan Hadary", "type": "Peop", "start": 12, "end": 14}, {"text": "Gospel", "type": "Other", "start": 36, "end": 37}, {"text": "Lordy", "type": "Other", "start": 43, "end": 44}], "orig_id": 5239}}, {"id": "conll04:train:23", "source": "conll04", "text": "SPACE CENTER , Houston ( AP )", "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start": 0, "end": 29, "parent": null, "level": 0}], "uri": null, "observed_at": 0, "grants": ["public"], "metadata": {"split": "train", "entities": [{"text": "SPACE CENTER", "type": "Org", "start": 0, "end": 2}, {"text": "Houston", "type": "Loc", "start": 3, "end": 4}, {"text": "AP", "type": "Org", "start": 5, "end": 6}], "orig_id": 355}}, {"id": "conll04:train:24", "source": "conll04", "text": "Grant B. Cooper , an attorney who defended Kennedy assassin Sirhan B. Sirhan , has died at age 87.", "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start": 0, "end": 98, "parent": null, "level": 0}], "uri": null, "observed_at": 0, "grants": ["public"], "metadata": {"split": "train", "entities": [{"text": "Grant B. Cooper", "type": "Peop", "start": 0, "end": 3}, {"text": "Kennedy", "type": "Peop", "start": 8, "end": 9}, {"text": "Sirhan B. Sirhan", "type": "Peop", "start": 10, "end": 13}], "orig_id": 5138}}, {"id": "conll04:train:25", "source": "c